  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet (2006-2011) genomf&#xf6;rs i samarbete mellan regeringarna i     Tanzania och Sweden.It syftar omvandla Dar es Salaam museet i         Nationalmuseum och House of Culture i Tanzania som ett centrer f&#xf6;r    kulturell kompetens i &#xf6;stra och s&#xf6;dra Afrika. Sidas bidrag till       projektet &#xe4;r MSEK 53,348</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project (2006-2011) is implemented in partnership between         governments of Tanzania and Sweden.It aims at transforming the Dar es Salaam Museum into the National Museum and House of Culture in        Tanzania as a centrer for cultural excellence in Eastern and Southern African. Sida&apos;s contribution to the project is MSEK 53.348</narrative>
